(text "MINICONSOLE / V1.7 HEADER CARRIER" (at 25.4 15.24 0) (effects (font (size 2.54 2.54)) (justify left)) (uuid f939afa4-9cea-5f93-9e3c-4db8a649a781))
(text "3.3V logic | SSD1306 128x64 | 6 active-low buttons | optional passive piezo" (at 25.4 24.13 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5b9a44d6-45a3-503f-a849-2866ffe4862a))
(text "J5: GND / 3V3 / SCL GPIO8 / SDA GPIO9. Shares OLED IIC bus and its pull-ups." (at 25.4 31.75 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid d1b268b6-9868-5bcc-8bf1-ab4e06159fc2))
(text "Button pull-ups are enabled in firmware. No external pull-ups required." (at 25.4 112 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 7f7ca323-60f0-5eb8-a8f6-0577eda6f261))
(text "OLED rotated 180deg: front view, header at TOP: GND VCC SCL SDA." (at 155 102 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0887e015-1777-5bc5-9216-123cb705d8d4))
(text "Battery + -> SW7 throw 3 -> COM 2 -> J3 -> module B+.\nJ3 B- -> module B-. Module 5V header is unused.\nUSB can power the console with the battery switch OFF.\nCharging the battery requires the battery switch ON." (at 255 31 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 400f8ed4-1542-503c-bc76-ee82edf5d5f9))
(text "J3 is a short insulated pigtail to the\nS3 underside B+/B- charging pads.\nSolder before fitting the module." (at 255 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid bc7f8e5b-f862-536a-8184-6222d378bfb8))
(text "R1 + B1 are optional / DNP.\nR1: 220 ohm, 1/4 W axial film.\nChoose B1 OR an external low-current\npassive piezo on J4. GPIO4 PWM.\nFirmware currently has sound disabled." (at 255 229 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 547ad1c9-8078-5810-82f6-9829c1b5faa0))
(text "Rear TP1-TP5: GND / 3V3 / switched BAT+ / SCL / SDA. Probe pads only; no extra components." (at 25.4 255.27 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 5841aa35-1047-58d2-9d98-da59e257ee1d))
(text "70.1 x 30.1mm, 1.6mm FR4, 2 copper layers. H1-H4: carrier mounts; H5-H8: OLED mounts." (at 25.4 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 0be27ef8-241c-55f6-a112-aeed34fc1673))
(text "Rear S3 uses two 9-pin headers, pitch 2.54mm, rows 15.24mm apart. USB toward bottom edge." (at 25.4 271.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 02562b89-1a45-5ba2-8873-d0f431dc126a))
(text "Fit-check the actual generic S3 against the 1:1 template before ordering. Published board size: 23.5 x 18mm." (at 25.4 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid 23eba7c7-8f35-5f00-bf0d-cd247a5f82e7))
